  "body": "Most of the tests removed by this PR are asserting that console methods exist and do not throw given random values. I think these days the at least the former is tested by https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/interfaces/console.idl, and the latter is tested by a lot of manual WPTs.\r\n\r\nI don't think there is a big benefit to keeping this around and I don't see any other tests that should be directly ported to WPTs, so I think it's OK to remove this top-level directory.\r\n\r\nFixes #152 and closes #182.",
